window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>An Amazon Top 100 Best Seller!</b></p> <p>They'll tell you I seduced them. Used my looks and body to lure them into my playground. <br> They'll tell you I'm a sinner. A demon who held them captive with temptation and lust. <br> They'll tell you I'm evil. A monster obsessed with the both of them. <br> They'll tell you they made a deal with the devil.<br> <b><i>What they won't tell you...is how much they liked it. </i></b></p> <p>Please note: This story contains content that may be offensive to some listeners.</p> <p>Please also note: <i>The Devil</i> is a full-length prelude novel!</p> <p><b><i>The Devil</i></b><b> was formerly part of the Cards of Love Collection. You do not need to listen to any other books in the collection in order to listen to </b><b><i>The Devil</i></b><b>.</b></p>"; 
